sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant T as Token endpoint
    participant B as MQTT broker
    B--xC: Connection lost
    loop Bounded retries with backoff and jitter
        opt Token renewal required
            C->>T: HTTPS POST /refresh_token<br/>previous valid signed token
            alt Token still valid
                T-->>C: Fresh access_token and MQTT metadata
            else Reissue rejected
                C->>T: HTTPS mTLS POST /request_token
                T-->>C: Fresh credentials or actionable error
            end
        end
        C->>B: CONNECT with current credentials
        B-->>C: CONNACK
    end
    C->>B: SUBSCRIBE required topics
    B-->>C: SUBACK
    Note over C,B: For Shadow, GET current state after subscribing
